+## Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-171717?logo=wasmer&logoColor=white)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=Bowen7%2Fregex-vis)
+
+The included `Anybuild` file tells Wasmer to run `pnpm install` and `pnpm run build` and serve the generated `dist` folder as static files, including the app page for `/samples` so that link also works when opened directly. The button opens Wasmer's import page for this public repository, where you review the detected settings (and correct them if needed) before clicking Deploy; nothing is deployed until you do. It does not create a copy of the repository in your GitHub account; to customize the app, fork the repository and import your fork instead.
+
